Moreover, there exists $C^*>0$ (independent of $d$) for which it holds that $\mathrm{depth}(\mathcal{U}^\varepsilon) \leq C^* \mathrm{depth}({\widehat{\varphi}}^\varepsilon)$ and $\{\mathrm{width},\mathrm{size}\}(\mathcal{U}^\varepsilon) \leq C^* \varepsilon^{-2}  \{\mathrm{width},\mathrm{size}\}({\widehat{\varphi}}^\varepsilon) $.

\begin{equation}
