let $\EuScript{U}^\theta \colon [0,T]\times \Omega\to [0,T]$, $\theta\in\Theta$, satisfy for all $t\in [0,T]$, $\theta\in\Theta$ that $\EuScript{U}_t^\theta = t + (T-t)Y^\theta$, 
