From Lemma \ref{lem:exp-to-prob} it then follows that
\begin{equation}
    \Prob{\int_{\mathbb{T}^d}\abs{U^0_n(t,x)-u(t,x)}^2d\mu(x) \leq \frac{4\mathcal{L}^2 (T+1)^2\exp(2LT)(1+2LT)^{2n}}{m^{n}\exp(-m)}} > 0. 
