Lemma \ref{lem:pendulum} with $s\leftarrow1$, $k\leftarrow r$ and $m\leftarrow p$ then provides a DeepONet that satisfies the conditions of Theorem \ref{thm:deeponet-to-pido} with $r^*=+\infty$ and equation \eqref{eq:growth} with $\sigma(s)=d/2+2sd$. The smoothness of $v$ is guaranteed by \cite[Lemma 4.3]{LMK1}. Moreover, it holds that, 
